Package: vennabers
Title: Binary Venn-Abers Calibration
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Venn-Abers", "Authors", email = "authors@invalid.example", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits binary Inductive and Cross Venn-Abers calibrators from
    caller-supplied probabilities. Returns Inductive Venn-Abers intervals
    and regularized probabilities, or Cross Venn-Abers regularized
    probabilities using equal-weight aggregation across matched folds.
    Supports log-loss or Brier regularization, calibration probability
    rounding, binary class predictions, and individual fold results.
    Includes Brier score, log loss, and a base R calibration plot.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
